  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Automated Debulking Machine</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Automated-Debulk-Mach-b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Gantry style debulk system</li>\n<li>Automated raising and lowering of lid</li>\n<li>Active cooling system supplies chilled air</li>\n<li>Siemens PLC controls heating, cooling and vacuum rates</li>\n<li>Heated tool interfaces with controller</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Forming / Compaction / Debulking</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/stringer-forming-and-trim-cell/\">Stringer Former and Trim Cell</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/stringer-former-i/\">Stringer Former I</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/stringer-former-ii/\">Stringer Former II</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/stringer-former-iii/\">Stringer Former III</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/hot-drape-forming/\">Hot Drape Forming</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/forming-on-contoured-surfaces/\">Forming on Contoured Surfaces</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/automated-debulking-machine/\">Automated Debulking Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/ir-thermoplastic-panel-preheater/\">IR Thermoplastic Panel Preheater</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Automated-Debulk-Mach-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Automated-Debulk-Mach-b-238x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"238\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Automated-Debulk-Mach-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07